 the person I'm sending my parcel to isn't going to be in for their delivery?",{"id":279,"href":280,"linkText":281},"YhzVjhIAAC0A7ZdP","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fwhat-can-i-do-if-the-person-im-sending-the-parcel-to-doesnt-want-it-any-more","What can I do if the person I'm sending the parcel to doesn't want it any more?",{"id":283,"href":284,"linkText":285},"aeCVyhEAACoAy-1P","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fpost-office-evri-parcel-help","I sent my parcel via the Post Office. Whom should I contact if something goes wrong?",{"id":287,"href":288,"linkText":289},"YhzZwxIAACsA7ar1","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fhow-will-i-know-when-my-parcel-has-been-delivered","How will I know when my parcel has been delivered?",{"id":291,"href":292,"linkText":293},"YhzcfRIAACgA7bfb","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fcan-i-change-the-delivery-address-after-ive-sent-a-parcel","Can I change the delivery address after I've sent a parcel?",{"id":295,"href":296,"linkText":297},"YhzbIhIAAC4A7bFY","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fhow-do-i-change-my-order-details","How do I change my order details?",{"id":299,"href":12,"linkText":300},"YhzbdBIAACkA7bLi","How do I cancel my order?",{"id":302,"href":303,"linkText":304},"YhzYgRIAACoA7aT5","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Finternational-deliveries","International deliveries",{"id":306,"href":307,"linkText":308},"aMKG1xIAACAAPQAR","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fhow-to-contact-customer-services-for-international-parcels","How to contact customer services for international parcels",{"categoryUid":310,"categoryTitle":311,"linkedPages":312},"lockers","Lockers",[313,317,321,325,329,333],{"id":314,"href":315,"linkText":316},"YhzQ2hIAACkA7YHk","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fcan-i-get-my-parcel-delivered-to-a-locker","Can I get my parcel delivered to a Locker?",{"id":318,"href":319,"linkText":320},"YhzTYRIAAC4A7Y0l","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fthe-locker-is-too-small-for-my-parcel-what-can-i-do","The locker is too small for my parcel, what can I do?",{"id":322,"href":323,"linkText":324},"YhzT2BIAAC0A7Y9S","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fwhat-is-a-locker","What is a Locker?",{"id":326,"href":327,"linkText":328},"YhzSehIAACkA7Yjg","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fim-having-trouble-with-the-locker-what-can-i-do","I'm having trouble with the Locker, what can I do?",{"id":330,"href":331,"linkText":332},"YhzRghIAACkA7YTp","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fhow-do-i-use-a-locker","How do I use a Locker?",{"id":334,"href":335,"linkText":336},"YhzS9RIAAC0A7Ysk","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fmy-barcode-isnt-scanning","My barcode isn't scanning","how-do-i-change-my-order-details",{"titleTag":339,"metaDescription":340,"canonical":341,"subpath2":342,"category":351,"linkText":297,"additionalHelp":6,"slices":359},"How do I change my order details? | FAQs | Evri","Keep your details up to date for straightforward parcel deliveries and returns. Get information on how to change your order details in our FAQs.","how-do-i-change-my-order-details.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fhow-do-i-change-my-order-details",{"id":343,"type":344,"tags":345,"lang":346,"slug":219,"first_publication_date":347,"last_publication_date":347,"uid":219,"link_type":348,"key":349,"isBroken":350},"Yhj0XBIAACgA3Cbr","subpath2",[],"en-gb","2022-02-25T15:23:13+0000","Document","07e3955a-cd01-45f2-bc8b-342da949a713",false,{"id":352,"type":353,"tags":354,"lang":346,"slug":219,"first_publication_date":356,"last_publication_date":357,"uid":219,"link_type":348,"key":358,"isBroken":350},"YiIZ7xIAACsABYGw","faq-category",[355],"FAQs","2022-03-04T13:53:55+0000","2022-05-12T12:48:33+0000","e1267099-fa27-436b-b59a-3e82b9189b9e",[360],{"variation":361,"version":362,"items":363,"primary":365,"id":486,"slice_type":487,"slice_label":488},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[364],{},{"content":366},[367,371,375,382,385,392,403,406,409,415,422,426,432,443,446,451,453,456,465,467,470],{"type":368,"text":297,"spans":369,"direction":370},"heading1",[],"ltr",{"type":372,"text":373,"spans":374,"direction":370},"paragraph","We understand that sometimes plans change - and we’re here to make things as easy as possible. ",[],{"type":372,"text":376,"spans":377,"direction":370},"If you’ve booked a parcel but haven’t handed it over to us yet, the quickest way to update your details is to cancel your order, then rebook with the correct information. Don’t worry - any payment you've made will be refunded soon. ",[378],{"start":379,"end":380,"type":381},110,127,"strong",{"type":372,"text":383,"spans":384,"direction":370},"Here’s how to cancel your order: ",[],{"type":386,"text":387,"spans":388,"direction":370},"o-list-item","Log in to your Evri account ",[389],{"start":390,"end":391,"type":381},0,27,{"type":386,"text":393,"spans":394,"direction":370},"Visit your Order History ",[395,402],{"start":396,"end":397,"type":398,"data":399},11,24,"hyperlink",{"link_type":10,"url":400,"target":401},"\u002Fcustomer\u002Faccount\u002Fhistory\u002F","_blank",{"start":396,"end":397,"type":381},{"type":386,"text":404,"spans":405,"direction":370},"Select the order you'd like to cancel ",[],{"type":386,"text":407,"spans":408,"direction":370},"We’ll process your refund right away ",[],{"type":410,"text":411,"spans":412,"direction":370},"heading4","Refund timings: ",[413],{"start":390,"end":414,"type":381},14,{"type":416,"text":417,"spans":418,"direction":370},"list-item","UK and international deliveries: Usually refunded within 3–5 working days",[419],{"start":420,"end":421,"type":381},57,73,{"type":423,"text":424,"spans":425,"direction":370},"heading3"," \nAlready handed your parcel over?",[],{"type":372,"text":427,"spans":428,"direction":370},"If your parcel is already in our network and turns out to be overweight or oversized, we’ll contact you to arrange payment for the difference. Your parcel will be held safely until the payment is made.  ",[429],{"start":430,"end":431,"type":381},61,84,{"type":372,"text":433,"spans":434,"direction":370},"Please note: We'll never ask your recipient to pay the difference for overweight or oversized parcels. If you’re unsure about the payment request, check our guide on how to spot and report potential fraud. ",[435,437,442],{"start":390,"end":436,"type":381},12,{"start":438,"end":439,"type":398,"data":440},166,204,{"link_type":10,"url":441,"target":401},"\u002Fcyber-security",{"start":438,"end":439,"type":381},{"type":372,"text":444,"spans":445,"direction":370}," ",[],{"type":372,"text":447,"spans":448,"direction":370},"Top tip: Double-check your parcel’s weight and size before booking to ensure a smooth journey all the way to your recipient! ",[449],{"start":390,"end":450,"type":381},8,{"type":372,"text":444,"spans":452,"direction":370},[],{"type":423,"text":454,"spans":455,"direction":370},"Got a parcel out for delivery? ",[],{"type":372,"text":457,"spans":458,"direction":370},"We know you won’t always be in to receive your parcels, that’s why our couriers will attempt to deliver up to three times. With each attempt, you can also choose to divert and receive your items when convenient for you. Check out our guide on how to divert your parcel for more information on your options. ",[459,464],{"start":460,"end":461,"type":398,"data":462},243,268,{"link_type":10,"url":463,"target":401},"\u002Fguides\u002Fdivert-your-parcel",{"start":460,"end":461,"type":381},{"type":372,"text":444,"spans":466,"direction":370},[],{"type":423,"text":468,"spans":469,"direction":370},"Need more help?",[],{"type":372,"text":471,"spans":472,"direction":370},"Visit your Order History to manage or cancel your order, or contact us if you’re unsure what to do next. For international parcels, please check our guidance on how to contact us for international parcels to reach the right support for your query.",[473,475,476,481,482,485],{"start":396,"end":397,"type":398,"data":474},{"link_type":10,"url":400,"target":401},{"start":396,"end":397,"type":381},{